# Deploy after task (m4trix)

When a coding or docs task is **finished** and changed tracked files, **deploy before ending**:

1. Run `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit` (fix failures first).
2. Commit only task-related files — never secrets or local test assets (e.g. `_test_*.mp3`).
3. Push to `master` (`git push origin master`). Push triggers the **Vercel Deploy** GitHub Action (`.github/workflows/vercel-deploy.yml`).
4. Report the commit SHA and that Vercel deploy was triggered. Optionally run `gh run list --workflow=vercel-deploy.yml --limit 1`.

Skip deploy when: no file changes, question-only work, user says skip/local-only, or push would require force.

Never force-push `master`. Never `--no-verify` unless the user explicitly asks.

Production URL: https://m4trix.vercel.app
